  "description": {
   "en": "Nagi got a sudden confession from her classmate Osaki-kun, a guy surrounded by scary rumors, and she rejected him in a heartbeat. She spent her days terrified of his revenge for turning him down, but it turns out Osaki-kun was nothing like the rumors—he’s actually a super kind, forest-bear-type guy! And on top of that, he hasn’t given up on her at all… This gap is just way too much!!!"
  },
